//www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/301500_301599/301549/03.02.01_60/en_301549v030201p.pdf",usedBy:"checks.catalogue",value:"EN 301 549 clause 9.1.2.3"},{claim:"EN 301 549 V3.2.1 clause 9.1.2.4 (Captions (live)) requires web pages to satisfy WCAG 2.1 Success Criterion 1.2.4.",excerpt:'"9.1.2.4 Captions (live) Where ICT is a web page, it shall satisfy WCAG 2.1 Success Criterion 1.2.4 Captions (Live)."',field:"other",file:"standards.md",id:"STD-EN-9.1.2.4",retrieved:"2026-11-03",source:"https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/301500_301599/301549/03.02.01_60/en_301549v030201p.pdf",usedBy:"checks.catalogue",value:"EN 301 549 clause 9.1.2.4"},{claim:"EN 301 549 V3.2.1 clause 9.1.2.5 (Audio description (pre-recorded)) requires web pages to satisfy WCAG 2.1 Success Criterion 1.2.5.",excerpt:'"9.1.2.5 Audio description (pre-recorded) Where ICT is a web page, it shall satisfy WCAG 2.1 Success Criterion 1.2.5 Audio Description (Prerecorded)."',field:"other",file:"standards.md",id:"STD-EN-9.1.2.5",retrieved:"2026-11-03",source:"https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/301500_301599/301549/03.02.01_60/en_301549v030201p.pdf",usedBy:"checks.catalogue",value:"EN 301 549 clause 9.1.2.5"},{claim:"EN 301 549 V3.2.1 clause 9.1.3.1 (Info and relationships) requires web pages to satisfy WCAG 2.1 Success Criterion 1.3.1.",excerpt:'"9.1.3.1 Info and relationships Where ICT is a web page, it shall satisfy WCAG 2.1 Success Criterion 1.3.1 Info and Relationships."',field:"other",file:"standards.md",id:"STD-EN-9.1.3.1",retrieved:"2026-11-03",source:"https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/301500_301599/301549/03.02.01_60/en_301549v030201p.pdf",usedBy:"checks.catalogue",value:"EN 301 549 clause 9.1.3.1"},{claim:"EN 301 549 V3.2.1 clause 9.1.3.2 (Meaningful sequence) requires web pages to satisfy WCAG 2.1 Success Criterion 1.3.2.",excerpt:'"9.1.3.2 Meaningful sequence Where ICT is a web page, it shall satisfy WCAG 2.1 Success Criterion 1.3.2 Meaningful Sequence."',field:"other",file:"standards.md",id:"STD-EN-9.1.3.2",retrieved:"2026-11-03",source:"https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/301500_301599/301549/03.02.01_60/en_301549v030201p.pdf",usedBy:"checks.catalogue",value:"EN 301 549 clause 9.1.3.2"},{claim:"EN 301 549 V3.2.1 clause 9.1.3.3 (Sensory characteristics) requires web pages to satisfy WCAG 2.1 Success Criterion 1.3.3.",excerpt:'"9.1.3.3 Sensory characteristics Where ICT is a web page, it shall satisfy WCAG 2.1 Success Criterion 1.3.3 Sensory Characteristics."',field:"other",file:"standards.md",id:"STD-EN-9.1.3.3",retrieved:"2026-11-03",source:"https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/301500_301599/301549/03.02.01_60/en_301549v030201p.pdf",usedBy:"checks.catalogue",value:"EN 301 549 clause 9.1.3.3"},{claim:"EN 301 549 V3.2.1 clause 9.1.3.4 (Orientation) requires web pages to satisfy WCAG 2.1 Success Criterion 1.3.4.",excerpt:'"9.1.3.4 Orientation Where ICT is a web page, it shall satisfy WCAG 2.1 Success Criterion 1.3.4 Orientation."',field:"other",file:"standards.md",id:"STD-EN-9.1.3.4",retrieved:"2026-11-03",source:"https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/301500_301599/301549/03.02.01_60/en_301549v030201p.pdf",usedBy:"checks.catalogue",value:"EN 301 549 clause 9.1.3.4"},{claim:"EN 301 549 V3.2.1 clause 9.1.3.5 (Identify input purpose) requires web pages to satisfy WCAG 2.1 Success Criterion 1.3.5.",excerpt:'"9.1.3.5 Identify input purpose Where ICT is a web page, it shall satisfy WCAG 2.1 Success Criterion 1.3.5 Identify Input Purpose."',field:"other",file:"standards.md",id:"STD-EN-9.1.3.5",retrieved:"2026-11-03",source:"https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/301500_301599/301549/03.02.01_60/en_301549v030201p.pdf",usedBy:"checks.catalogue",value:"EN 301 549 clause 9.1.3.5"},{claim:"EN 301 549 V3.2.1 clause 9.1.4.1 (Use of colour) requires web pages to satisfy WCAG 2.1 Success Criterion 1.4.1.",excerpt:'"9.1.4.1 Use of colour Where ICT is a web page, it shall satisfy WCAG 2.1 Success Criterion 1.4.1 Use of Color."',field:"other",file:"standards.md",id:"STD-EN-9.1.4.1",